{"product_id":"royal-ember-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Royal Ember – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBold, luxurious, and crafted with a commanding presence, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRoyal Ember\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that brings together the striking beauty of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblack-stained Canadian maple and rich rosewood\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e with the brilliance of handcrafted abalone and vibrant multi-colored veneers.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Canadian maple forearm, stained in deep black\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, provides a dramatic foundation for striking \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003erosewood and abalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, framed by carefully layered \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003emulti-colored veneers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. The combination creates exceptional contrast and visual depth while highlighting the precision and artistry of the handcrafted design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe centerpiece continues through the handle with a rich \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ered crocodile wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, adding luxurious texture, a confident grip, and a powerful burst of color against the deep black and warm rosewood tones. Its deep crimson character gives the cue a distinctive identity while maintaining an elegant and sophisticated presence.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMeticulously crafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e add subtle flashes of natural iridescence throughout the cue, tying the inlay work together and providing a refined finishing detail. Every element has been thoughtfully balanced to create a design that feels both classic and contemporary.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors, the Royal Ember combines \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium hardwoods, intricate inlay work, layered veneers, natural abalone, and luxury materials\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e into a truly commanding custom cue. It is a statement of craftsmanship designed for those who appreciate individuality and exceptional detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWoods:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Black-Stained Canadian Maple \u0026amp; Rosewood\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Rosewood \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eVeneers:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Multi-Colored Veneers\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Red Crocodile Wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlack-stained Canadian maple. Rich rosewood. Crimson crocodile. Iridescent abalone. A commanding expression of handcrafted luxury, created for those who demand something truly distinctive.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484734193712,"sku":null,"price":25000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/789.png?v=1786606695","url":"https:\/\/cuesmastershop.com\/products\/royal-ember-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","provider":"Cues Master Shop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}